    {
      "title": "instrumentation.ts, Error Boundaries and Reporting",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "instrumentation.ts, Error Boundaries and Reporting",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. instrumentation.ts",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "At project root (or `src/`); ==register()== runs once per server instance at startup",
                "Use it to init **OpenTelemetry** or an error SDK",
                "Guard runtime-specific code with `NEXT_RUNTIME`, or Edge bundling breaks",
                "==onRequestError== reports render, route handler, action and middleware errors"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "typescript",
              "lines": [
                "export async function register() {",
                "  if (process.env.NEXT_RUNTIME === 'nodejs') {",
                "    await import('./instrumentation-node')",
                "  }",
                "}",
                "export async function onRequestError(err, request, context) {",
                "  await report(err, request.path, context.routePath)",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "report() = your Sentry-style call"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Error Boundaries",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "File",
                "Replaces",
                "Must"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`error.tsx`",
                  "segment children",
                  "`'use client'`, gets `{error, reset}`"
                ],
                [
                  "`global-error.tsx`",
                  "root layout",
                  "render own `<html>` and `<body>`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`error.tsx` does {red:not} catch its same-level layout",
                "Call `reset()` to retry",
                "Production: client gets a generic message plus ==error.digest==, match it in server logs"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Not Caught",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Event handlers and async code skip boundaries: use `try/catch`",
                "Expected errors: **return** them from Server Actions (`useActionState`), never throw"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "==register()== inits, ==onRequestError== reports, `error.tsx` is client-only, `global-error` needs html/body."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
